      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Although I am a little aware, this is a quick menu, including to offer a VRC+ gift, it is very good here and I saw all your publications on canny, you are very bothered by the VRC+ buttons to what I see, I think Tupper or the developers are not removing this button\n\nEspecially if you've read the beta update, you can give VRC+ gifts to anyone in the instance :) so this button literally belongs here especially if you don't want to choose a specific player\n\nQueen!",
